#-------------
PEANUT
#-------------
Biomes 		 - Jungle
Spawn Conditions - None
Tag		 - Defense / Offense
#-------------
SUN	 	 - 6
HP 		 - 45
#-------------
Additional Notes - Acts like a peashooter / repeater as well as a wallnut.
Tanks damage while dishing out peas to Zombies.
Fires two peas at 0.4 / 0.8 second intervals depending on health.
Has a rare chance to mutate into a Three-Nut.
#-------------
